<title>NORWAY: Norway N. Sea oil output normal, loadings patchy.</title>
<headline>Norway N. Sea oil output normal, loadings patchy.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Friday production at the North Sea Statfjord and Gullfaks oilfields was normal.</p>
<p>One tanker was waiting for calmer weather to load at the Gullfaks development, a Statoil spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no loading at Statfjord because there are no tankers,&quot; she said. &quot;The first tankers are due to arrive there tomorrow night.&quot;</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
